{
 "_doc": [
  "Round 657 (the user: 'apply that [1px black outline] to all cave entrances that don't have one. Let's also make that the rule for entrances moving forward').",
  "outline: the entrance sprites that had no outline, outlined by dev-tools/poi_outline.py --apply (re-running skips any already outlined).",
  "reviewed_ok: entrance sprites whose outline score sits in 0.30-0.65 (a dark-outlined cave on a soft drop shadow scores there) that were checked by eye and already carry an outline - poi_outline.py --audit does not report them.",
  "A NEW entrance sprite: run poi_outline.py --audit; outline what it reports, or add it here once checked.",
  "Round 669: the Realm of Legends lairs' entrances - Building21 / Building42 / Castle / Slobad reviewed (a dark outline on a soft drop shadow), banditcave (Thieves' Hideout) and Siren (Skeleton Ship) outlined.",
  "Round 674: the smaller Realm of Legends lairs - Building148 / Building50 / Cave / Grove / Building13 reviewed (a dark outline on a soft drop shadow); FlamingoPond (Blor's Pond) and ruinedcity (Isolated Dunes), upstream sprites, outlined onto entrances_outlined; Snarl (Rathi Shadow Rift) outlined in place.",
  "Round 805: the gauntlet dungeons' entrances - BlueTempleOvergrown and Spare_E_Kenriths_Court outlined in place, Spare_E_Wizard_Palace (on common buildings.png) copied and outlined onto entrances_outlined; Graveyard_A and Graveyard_D reviewed: their dark iron fence is the outline, and an auto-outline would line the open plots inside with black (preview: the Art project's notes/gauntlet_dungeons/r805_entrance_outlines_preview.png)."
 ],
